Package: wb-docker-app
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3, docker-compose-plugin
Description: Shared helper for containerized services on Wiren Board controllers
 wb-docker-app is the shared lifecycle helper for Wiren Board docker-based
 service packages. It ships the single templated systemd unit
 wb-docker-app@.service, the wb-docker-app CLI (provision-mqtt/install/remove/
 reload-proxy) and the shell library that service maintainer scripts source.
 The dangerous host integration (seeding /mnt/data, the dedicated MQTT network
 + mosquitto gateway listener, systemd wiring, tolerant nginx reload) lives here
 once and is reused by every service package via Depends, refcounted by apt.
